\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 An industrial robot is one that is an \'93automatically controlled, reprogrammable multipurpose manipulator, programmable in three or more axes, which can be either fixed in place or fixed to a mobile platform for use in automation applications in an industrial environment" ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso:8373:ed-3:v1:en"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 ISO 8373:2021}}).
